  "faqQ1": "How do I make a booking?",
  "faqA1": "Search for a trip on the home page, select the journey that suits you, choose your seat and proceed with payment via Orange Money or MTN Mobile Money.",
  "faqQ2": "What payment methods are accepted?",
  "faqA2": "We accept Orange Money (OM) and MTN Mobile Money (MoMo). Payments are fully secure, encrypted, and processed instantly.",
  "faqQ3": "No USSD code received during payment?",
  "faqA3": "If the USSD confirmation prompt does not display automatically, don't worry! Manually dial your operator's backup code (*126# for MTN or #150*4*4# for Orange) to authorize the transaction within a few minutes.",
  "faqQ4": "How long before departure should I arrive at the station?",
  "faqA4": "We strongly advise arriving at the boarding station at least 45 minutes before departure to check-in baggage and validate your digital ticket.",
  "faqQ5": "How do I get my ticket after purchase?",
  "faqA5": "Your digital ticket is generated instantly after payment validation. You can find it under the \"Tickets\" tab in the form of a QR Code to present at the boarding gate.",
  "faqQ6": "Can I cancel or reschedule a trip?",
  "faqA6": "You can cancel or request a reschedule up to 24 hours before departure from your reservation details under the \"Tickets\" tab. A small cancellation fee may be charged by the agency.",
